<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 269 ALL OUT IN 49.2 OVERS V ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 269 ALL OUT IN 49.2 OVERS V ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were all out for 269 off 49.2 overs in the third and final one-day international against England at Lord's on Sunday.</p>
</text>
